Wizards are the most fun, IMHO, but again they are highly variable.
There's a reason why they get rerollscummed so much.

Wizards are very weak, and their magical abilities are not that great
early on. Their quest artifact is almost a disadvantage - you can't get it
until you've done the quest, whereas other roles are free to wish it up as
soon as they can. Their starting cloak is really their only major
advantage in the early game.

So again, it is /possible/ for wizards to have all kinds of advantages,
but you can't guarantee them, and if you've only got one shot at an
ascension, then you've got to take every advantage you can get, and that
means playing a Valkyrie.

